{"id": "Dfhn2EwxpQl", "title": "Video by anim_aman", "description": "Usne chhatri aage badhayi thi… bas ek baar ke liye. ☔💔\n\nBaarish wali raat, sheher ka ek signal. Woh is paar khada tha, haath mein chhatri lekar. Woh us paar, laal dress mein, purane zakhmon ke saath.\nKabhi ek hi chhatri ke neeche dono hanste the… ab woh phone ulta rakh deti hai.\nSignal hara hua, usne ek kadam badhaya… aur beech se ek bus guzar gayi.\nBus gayi, toh woh bhi ja chuki thi. Woh ab bhi wahin khada hai, chhatri aage kiye… kisi ke liye nahi.\n\nवफ़ाओं की हमसे तवक्को नहीं है,\nमगर एक बार आज़मा कर तो देखो...\n\nNusrat Fateh Ali Khan saab ki “Tumhe Dillagi Bhool Jani Padegi”, har us dil ke liye jo bas ek mauka maangta hai. NFAK, sad qawwali, baarish, ek adhoori mohabbat 🤍\n\n🎵 Tumhe Dillagi Bhool Jani Padegi · Nusrat Fateh Ali Khan\n\nUs insaan ko bhejo jise tum bas ek baar aazmana chahte the… ya jisne tumhe kabhi aazmaya hi nahi 🥀\n\n#nusratfatehalikhan #nfak #heartbreak", "channel": "anim_aman", "uploader_id": "52657595533", "uploader": "Aman", "timestamp": 1794237106, "like_count": 1186, "comment_count": 4, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1511273700814734a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 69.477, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQMqmLrYMTpdCseelcpphS8Ggy71-9pOtcPWdlurgahN-MrndIf7rBZAwO2keMJ7nfViilE40Ms3EYgRHYzF2D2BIpohrwugHToLxgM.mp4?_nc_cat=106&_nc_oc=AdovxcomA2QNQaD0w_e6P6LSOo8VwLX4XuKkZ5gCkhJo-plbZUSiBT2VH2C7EnssuYUx2tALwAAWC1Lnod7Zo0PP&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=3MlMT5t_pB4Q7kNvwHRK7yn&&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=L3RVguv03Vv_NyFmQ_TA-g&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQT9N2wHWcMEbznkkT66BCgzOj52molr20CZmvJ1n3JBqg&oe=6AF4529F", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0